        "original_id": "279c5f71-f073-50e1-bfc3-d6bc83db41a3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Original Soundtrack, \"I'm Not in Love\", \"Life Is a Minestrone\", Relayted\n- People: Eric Stewart, Graham Gouldman\n- Organizations: 10cc\n- Concepts: inspiration, song tempo\n\nFacts:\n- 10cc released \"I'm Not in Love\" and \"Life Is a Minestrone\" as singles from The Original Soundtrack.\n- \"I'm Not in Love\" became 10cc's most popular song.\n- \"I'm Not in Love\" is a song by the English group 10cc.\n- Eric Stewart and Graham Gouldman wrote \"I'm Not in Love\" as members of 10cc.\n- Relayted was inspired by 10cc's \"I'm Not in Love\".\n- Every song on Relayted was recorded at 69 BPM.",
